cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software, please cite it as below."
title: "YarnHair: rule-based measurement of yarn hairiness from microscope images"
abstract: >-
  YarnHair measures yarn hairiness (number of hairs, total protruding length and
  tip-distance classes per 10 mm) from microscope images of a straight yarn
  segment. Hairs are detected by their line shape with a ridge filter, and every
  hair is traced back to the yarn body boundary, which is never narrower than the
  theoretical yarn diameter. Graphical program and command-line interface in
  English and Turkish.
version: 1.0.0
license: MIT
authors:
